# STIG RHEL-09-252075: There must be no .shosts files on RHEL 9.
# STIG ID: V-257956 (HIGH)

META
    esp_id `r9-rhel-09-252075-no-shosts-files-001`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `rocky9`
    criticality `critical`

    title `STIG RHEL-09-252075: There must be no .shosts files on RHEL 9.`
    description `There must be no .shosts files on RHEL 9.`
    author `example-security`
    tags `rhel9,stig,disa-stig,filesystem`

    control_mapping `DISA-STIG:RHEL-09-252075,NIST-800-53:CM-6`
    control_objective `CM-6`

    assessment_method `TEST`
    implementation_status `implemented`
    responsible_role `system-admin`

    control_origination `sp-system`
    inherited_from `Rocky9:localhost:os-hardening`
    customer_responsibility `configuration`

    remediation_days `1`
    recommendation `Review and remediate per DISA STIG guidance for RHEL-09-252075.`

    component_id `comp-r9-os`

    impl_CM_6 `This control is validated by checking the required system configuration against the DISA STIG baseline for RHEL 9.`

META_END

DEF
    OBJECT target
        path `/etc/ssh/shosts.equiv`
    OBJECT_END

    STATE meta_check
        exists boolean = false
    STATE_END

    CRI AND
        CTN file_metadata
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF meta_check
            OBJECT_REF target
        CTN_END
    CRI_END
DEF_END
